Package: ssMRCT
Type: Package
Title: Regional Consistency Evaluation and Sample Size Calculation for MRCTs
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Kunhai", "Qing", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "kunhaiq@stu.ecnu.edu.cn"),
    person("Xinru", "Ren", role = "aut"),
    person("Jin", "Xu", role = "aut"))
Description: Calculate conditional regional consistency probabilities and sample sizes
    for multi-regional clinical trials under fixed-effects and random-effects
    models. Supports two independent trials, regional fraction selection under
    symmetric designs, and doubly robust regional treatment-effect estimation.
    Methods include Qing et al. (2025) <doi:10.1002/sim.70306>
    and Ren and Xu (2026) <doi:10.1002/pst.70090>.
